<title>USA: CRA Managed Care acquires service co.</title>
<headline>CRA Managed Care acquires service co.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CRA Managed Care Inc said it has acquired First Notice Systems Inc for $40 million in cash.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be non-dilutive to CRA's 1997 earnings, it said.</p>
<p>First Notice handles initial loss and injury claims in workers' compensation and auto insurance cases.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
</text>
